{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o081a","title":"诸葛亮求诸葛瑾子乔为嗣孙权遣西改字任驸马都尉","accounts":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o081a-account","label":"《诸葛亮传第五》正文","text":"诸葛亮求诸葛瑾子乔为嗣孙权遣西改字任驸马都尉","evidence":["zhuge-e-o081a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"请嗣","evidence":["zhuge-e-o081a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"请遣","evidence":["zhuge-e-o081a-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"遣子","evidence":["zhuge-e-o081a-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-p0053","role":"入嗣受任","evidence":["zhuge-e-o081a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"诸葛乔继嗣至卒","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhuge-e-o081a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o081a-q","source_order":[35,405,"O081a"],"order":6821}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0002","name":"诸葛瑾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-p0053","name":"诸葛乔","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o081a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-4942f87dced041fcf142","layer":"original","quote":"乔字伯松。亮兄瑾之第二子也〖1〗。本字仲慎，与兄元逊俱有名于时〖2〗；论者以为乔才不及兄，而性业过之〖3〗。初，亮未有子，求乔为嗣，瑾启孙权遣乔来西；亮以乔为己嫡子，故易其字焉〖4〗。拜为驸马都尉，随亮至汉中。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":404,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
